{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1PE","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"彼得前书","commonName":"彼得前书","title":"彼得前书","order":60,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"888f1d98a26aa5a44ed454975d0c256de96d3ed0f30c63ea333bed3950296850","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1PE/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1PE/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":104},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["劝勉长老"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我作为长老，也作为基督受苦的见证人和同享将要显明之荣耀的人，劝你们中间做长老的："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["务要牧养上帝托付给你们的羊群，按上帝的旨意照顾他们，不是出于勉强，不是为了谋利，而是出于甘心，出于热诚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["不要辖制托付给你们的羊群，而是要做群羊的榜样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["等到大牧长显现的时候，你们必得到永不衰残的荣耀冠冕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你们年轻的要顺服年长的，大家都要存谦卑的心彼此服侍。因为上帝阻挡骄傲的人，恩待谦卑的人。",{"noteId":12}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["所以你们要在上帝大能的手下谦卑，时候到了，祂必提升你们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你们要把一切忧虑卸给祂，因为祂眷顾你们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你们务要谨慎、警醒，因为你们的仇敌魔鬼好像咆哮的狮子四处游走，寻找可以吞吃的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你们要以坚定的信心抵挡它，要知道世界各地的弟兄姊妹在遭受同样的苦难。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["你们忍受短暂的苦难之后，广施恩典、在基督里呼召你们享受祂永远荣耀的上帝必亲自复兴你们，使你们刚强、笃定、坚立。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["愿权能归给祂，直到永永远远。阿们！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["问候"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["在忠心的弟兄西拉的帮助下，我简单地写了这封信劝勉你们，并证明这是上帝真实的恩典。你们务要在这恩典上站稳。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["在巴比伦和你们一同蒙拣选的教会问候你们，我的儿子马可也问候你们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["你们要以爱心彼此亲吻问候。 愿平安归给你们所有在基督里的人！"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"箴言3:34。","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1PE/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2PE/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1PE/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}